    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udff0 One world. One winner. Then it all begins again.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Conquest! is a persistent multiplayer strategy game where players battle in a live, shared world \u2014 until one emerges victorious. Born on IRC in 1993, rebuilt for modern platforms, it\u2019s fast, brutal, and unforgiving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd52 <strong>Instant command resolution</strong> \u2014 no waiting, no fluff<br>\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Persistent world</strong> \u2014 all players affect a single, shared game<br>\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Wage war across 3 distinct regions</strong> in every Age <br>\ud83d\udc51 <strong>The world resets only when a player wins</strong> \u2014 can you survive to the end?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s no base-building. No animations. No filler. Just raw strategy and a world that never resets... until someone conquers it all.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1771260/extras/6f3f85135407166e3946b8fd62069041.avif?t=1754389968\" /></div> </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udff0 One world. One winner. Then it all begins again.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Conquest! is a persistent multiplayer strategy game where players battle in a live, shared world \u2014 until one emerges victorious. Born on IRC in 1993, rebuilt for modern platforms, it\u2019s fast, brutal, and unforgiving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd52 <strong>Instant command resolution</strong> \u2014 no waiting, no fluff<br>\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Persistent world</strong> \u2014 all players affect a single, shared game<br>\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Wage war across 3 distinct regions</strong> in every Age <br>\ud83d\udc51 <strong>The world resets only when a player wins</strong> \u2014 can you survive to the end?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s no base-building. No animations. No filler. Just raw strategy and a world that never resets... until someone conquers it all.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1771260/extras/6f3f85135407166e3946b8fd62069041.avif?t=1754389968\" /></div> </p>",
